{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"CLSA-2022-1667496000","published":"2022-11-03T17:20:00Z","modified":"2026-06-01T00:32:39.039587338Z","summary":"Update of tzdata","details":"- Upgrade to tzdata-2022c\n  - Add a work-around for an awk bug in FreeBSD, macOS, etc\n  - Improve tzselect with respect to intercontinental Zones\n  - Chile transitions to DST on 2022-09-11, not 2022-09-04\n  - 'make install' now defaults LOCALTIME to Factory rather than GMT\n  - More zones that are the same since 1970 have been moved to backzone","affected":[{"package":{"name":"tzdata","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.5","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/tzdata?distro=centos-8.5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2022c-1.el8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.5els/CLSA-2022-1667496000.json"}},{"package":{"name":"tzdata-java","ecosystem":"TuxCare:CentOS:8.5","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/tzdata-java?distro=centos-8.5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2022c-1.el8.tuxcare.els1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/centos8.5els/CLSA-2022-1667496000.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.cloudlinux.com/centos8.5-els/CLSA-2022-1667496000.html"}]}